{'symbol': 'MA', 'date': '2022-12-06 16:06:00', 'title': 'MASTERCARD BOARD OF DIRECTORS ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND AND $9 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM', 'text': 'PURCHASE, N.Y.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MASTERCARD INCORPORATED (NYSE: MA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 57 CENTS PER SHARE, A 16 PERCENT INCREASE OVER THE PREVIOUS DIVIDEND OF 49 CENTS PER SHARE. THE CASH DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON FEBRUARY 9, 2023 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD OF ITS CLASS A COMMON STOCK AND CLASS B COMMON STOCK AS OF JANUARY 9, 2023.'}